1.0 COMPLETE RELEASE — COLOSSEUM BATTLE ENVIRONMENTS + COLOSSEUM-INSPIRED UI
• Complete Colosseum arena presentation with fidelity, trainer, Pokemon animation, MoveFX, audio and camera improvements.
• Includes Android-safe battle-host recovery, GLES-compatible arena shader fallback, depth-target fallback and isolated render-pass recovery.
• Prevents renderer faults from leaving black or white battle screens while preserving normal battle flow.
• Existing valid generated model, arena, MoveFX and audio caches remain reusable.
